# Ad-hoc local run output - a script or test framework writing its
# results to the repo root instead of reports/ or data/ (which are
# already ignored above). alerts.log, daily_report.html, dashboard.html,
# results.json, 20260524_results.json, and test.txt were all committed
# by accident this same way and had to be manually removed.
/results.json
/*_results.json
/daily_report.html
/dashboard.html
/test.txt

